{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":13885749,"name":"Onomatopoeia","username":"Onomatopoeia-2544047","avatar_template":"/en/wow/plugins/discourse-blizzard-plugin/images/avatars/wow/default.png","created_at":"2021-06-30T00:28:52.119Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eJust did the pandaren spirit battles for today. I use PetTracker to keep tabs on enemy cooldowns and noticed my team was getting slaughtered unexpectedly because my ability cooldowns weren’t lining up with theirs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI fled the battle and reset a few times to see what was happening. For example against the burning pandaren spirit, which has conflagrate on a 4 round cooldown, I use Anubisath Idol with a 3 round cooldown on deflection. It should be available for every conflag cast.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI noticed that when it got down to cooldown 2 rounds on conflag, the battle would suddenly fast forward (a bunch of spells and actions occurred in quick succession) and my idol would take a big hit and conflag would be on cooldown again (4 rounds).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom looking at the combat log, I could see two rounds of combat passed within 1 second with nothing happening between either my side or enemy side except for the immolate dot followed by a conflag. Something very similar happened with the whispering pandaren spirit tamer battle.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSomething is very broken.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-06-27T10:04:18.783Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":35,"reads":15,"readers_count":14,"score":193.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":1013569,"topic_slug":"pandaria-grand-master-pet-tamer-bug-possibly-others","display_username":"Onomatopoeia","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":