 healed 69 damage from your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 9\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Immolate] dealt 138 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Crush] dealt 177 damage to enemy Pandaren Fire Spirit.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Immolate] dealt 14 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Recovery] healed 69 damage from your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 10\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Immolate] dealt 14 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 11\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Immolate] dealt 14 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 12\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Conflagrate] dealt 457 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Conflagrate] dealt 103 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Crush] dealt 322 damage to enemy Pandaren Fire Spirit.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Immolate] dealt 14 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Recovery] healed 69 damage from your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExcerpt from Whispering Pandaren Spirit combat log:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnubisath Idol is now your active pet.\u003cbr\u003e\nDusty is now enemy active pet.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 1\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Deflection] applied [Deflection] to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Moth Dust] was dodged by your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Deflection] fades from your Anubisath Idol.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRound 2\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n[Cocoon Strike] dealt 167 damage to your Anubisath Idol.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Cocoon Strike] applied [Silk Cocoon] to enemy Dusty.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Sandstorm] was blocked from striking enemy Dusty.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Silk Cocoon] fades from enemy Dusty.\u003cbr\u003e\n[Sandstorm] changed the weather to [Sandstorm].\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c